WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.625
Before the pitch, every defender has a job.

2
00:00:03.655 --> 00:00:05.185
Start with the ball.

3
00:00:05.665 --> 00:00:08.408
A ground ball goes to shortstop.

4
00:00:08.438 --> 00:00:10.488
The shortstop fields it.

5
00:00:10.968 --> 00:00:14.630
Second base is covered by the second baseman.

6
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.518
First base stays ready.

7
00:00:16.998 --> 00:00:21.875
If the ball goes to second base, the shortstop covers second.

8
00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:26.672
Choose your job: get the ball, cover a base, or back up.

9
00:00:27.355 --> 00:00:28.496
Now try the play.

10
00:00:28.526 --> 00:00:31.250
Where should you go when the ball moves?
